  "name": "hermes-gate",
  "description": "Bounded, receipt-bound completion rail for coding agents. Runs a repository's own checks, records exactly which content and tool versions were checked, and reuses a PASS only while those bytes still match. No daemon, no runtime dependencies beyond Python 3.11+ and Git.",
